{
 "notes": "Clean, centered, white-page look built in Elementor containers (flexbox, default boxed width; a few use boxed_width 1280). Almost everything is center-aligned: headings (align:center), text-editor (align:center), buttons (align:center), images centered. Headings are bright blue #009CDE (also #00A0E3 on Enrollment/Graduation), Roboto, weight 600 for page titles (H1 45-60px), section H2 ~34px (Enhancements) or 48px (Enrollment) via typography_font_size only; small card H3s use deep green #1D4010. Body text is black #000000 (About/Enrollment/Graduation) or deep green #1D4010 (Enhancements), default kit font size (some 15-21px). Brand palette: blue #009CDE / #00A0E3, dark blue accent #037CAF, deep green #1D4010, light green #BFE0B4, pink accent #F2A6C6, card greens #57C64D, navy #0004AE. Buttons: owner's styled buttons are solid blue #009CDE bg, white text, border_radius 8px (rounded-square, NOT pill), text_padding 14/28, 16px; inverse button white bg + blue text on blue band. Older pages use unstyled default kit buttons (Graduation one has radius 10 + padding 15). Sections: plain containers with bottom margin 64px (40 mobile); highlighted bands use light-green #BFE0B4 bg with 16px radius and 40-48/32 padding, closing CTA band solid #009CDE with white text. Cards: white bg containers with 12-14px radius, 24-28/16-20 padding, NO box-shadow (no native box_shadow used anywhere); featured card gets 3px solid #F2A6C6 border. Icon-list used on Enrollment (fas fa-circle bullets, 16px icons, 18px text, black, 16px spacing). __globals__ appear only as empty strings — owner uses hard-coded hex, not global colors. Widget frequency (owner only, 4 pages): text-editor and heading most common, then container, button, ucaddon_circle_number_widget (About), ucaddon_material_footer_card (Graduation), icon-list, icon, image, video, eael-post-grid, ucaddon_blox_line_diamond_seperator, one html (withdrawal letter tool). Note: Enhancements page element ids (pg00001, rr00001, fin0001...) look hand-written/generated rather than Elementor random ids, but are not 'asu' so were treated as owner's.",
